A||N||5||AusFiero||Ok who wants a 2002 Calendar ? - Question for you here to Cliff||||1||
Z||000000||AusFiero||07-07-2001||02:06 AM||||Well I know it isn't a new idea. But I decided to put some incentive in it for everyone.<P>I was thinking of doing a lot of artwork. Limited edition framed prints etc and need a lot of pictures of Fieros to do it.<P>So I figured if I am going to do a lot of artwork why not make this calendar everyone has been asking about using a collection of 12 of the prints as artwork for the calendars. <P>It would be a free downloadable calendar of course. What size do people like A4 wall size or a desk size? Or ask the obvious I suppose. Both?<P>Now the incentive bit. As I need pictures, high resolution good ones in at least 1024 X 768 and above if anybody is willing to email pictures to fiero@auto-alley.com. They have to be high resolution for future for high quality printing.<P>Or even  better if you could mail actual photoprints to <BR>Jim Davis<BR>5 Barham Place<BR>West Dapto<BR>NSW Australia 2530 <P>Real prints are much better to work off due to the higher DPI of photolabs.<P>Out of all the pictures I get I will select what I think are the best 12 for the calendar, do the artwork using them cars then put them online for you to vote on. After a set period the winning car will receive a high quality framed print of their car in its new artwork surrounds. It will be signed and certificate verified by myself as print 1 of 20. <P>The other artwork will become limited edition framed and numbered prints of 20 only available for sale. The owners of the cars in the other 11 prints would have first option on print 1 of their car for a heavy discount.<P>Sorry for making you read to here Cliff just to ask if it is OK to use the Pennocks logo on the cover of the calendar. Can I ? It would not be associated with the framed prints in any way.<P>Anyone elses ideas, input?<P>Heres a small quick sample in net resolution. Printable artwork will be much more detailed.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/fieroart001.jpg"> <P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero/fiero5.gif">   <BR><A HREF="http://www.jadeweb.com.au/fiero" TARGET=_blank>My Fiero</A><BR>Need a Subwoofer Console or Speaker Door Pods?||||reg||1
